<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-100-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.434795" lon="-120.980722"><name>SC26-100-A</name><cmt>SC26-100</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 10.9 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 77/100; not catch probability. Center 108 ft; nearby 99–125 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-081</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.43799483252839" lon="-120.9806971998061"/><trkpt lat="35.43766384754566" lon="-120.98246793709491"/><trkpt lat="35.43696135307128" lon="-120.9835870036493"/><trkpt lat="35.436512633003524" lon="-120.98370834894719"/><trkpt lat="35.4356059954069" lon="-120.98340050664532"/><trkpt lat="35.43551036419368" lon="-120.98307243782028"/><trkpt lat="35.4349660128624" lon="-120.98286571699833"/><trkpt lat="35.434960492161366" lon="-120.98253540273866"/><trkpt lat="35.43441798052779" lon="-120.98243879079129"/><trkpt lat="35.433862582774545" lon="-120.98157145747291"/><trkpt lat="35.433592247274746" lon="-120.98157820649178"/><trkpt lat="35.43312879746551" lon="-120.98081873951497"/><trkpt lat="35.432764666366616" lon="-120.98060753804133"/><trkpt lat="35.432757297390026" lon="-120.98016713164861"/><trkpt lat="35.43284